        <mxCell id="summary" value="PATTERN A SUMMARY: ELT warehouse-centric. Raw Parquet from S3 loaded into Snowflake AMO_BRONZE via external stage + COPY INTO. Weather enrichment from Open-Meteo API loaded via Python connector. All transformation in Snowflake via dbt Core 1.12.0: staging models union Yellow and Green, reconcile schemas, derive time and weather features, flag data quality issues. Mart models join trips to zones and weather, filter to valid records, aggregate demand and revenue by borough/weather/time for YoY analysis. Team-scoped schemas (AMO_*) prevent cross-team interference." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=9;fontColor=#444444;spacingLeft=5;spacingRight=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="820" width="1380" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
